     "content": {
      "size": 61985,
      "mimeType": "text/plain",
      "text": "{\"errcode\":0,\"data\":{\"shop_info\":{\"id\":12399,\"shop_id\":\"zhounianqin_cz\",\"is_open\":\"Y\",\"channel\":\"kxyxzx\",\"create_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"currency\":\"8\",\"shop_extra\":null,\"goods\":{\"tuijian\":[{\"id\":746322,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"xinbawangqiangfa\",\"price\":4000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":44,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200007,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"霸王枪法\",\"dsc\":\"相传这是昔日楚霸王所使的枪法，招式大开大合一往无前。霸王天生神力，单手持枪比寻常人双手持枪还要灵活。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746323,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"yidaoliu\",\"price\":4000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":43,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200024,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"一刀流\",\"dsc\":\"名震日本的武学，集东瀛剑道的精华，并吸收了一些中原武学的优点，既有刀法的凌厉，也有剑法的迅捷。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746324,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"chunjieleiji4\",\"price\":4000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":45,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200025,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"虚空踏步\",\"dsc\":\"此功非内力深厚之人不可练，练至高深之处，可虚空连踏数十步，精妙无比。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746325,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"jiulongbianfa\",\"price\":3000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":47,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200028,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"九龙鞭法\",\"dsc\":\"淮南一老武师所创，此鞭法之精髓在于，虽只一鞭在手，但施展之时，却犹如九条鞭子齐攻对手，使对手防无可防，遂得名九龙鞭法。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746326,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"yuanxiaoleiji4\",\"price\":4000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":40,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200045,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"五行遁法\",\"dsc\":\"五行遁法源自《遁甲天书》，相传此书乃是乌角先生得天所授，却也不知真假，习得此术者每日可使用七七四十九次遁地之术。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746327,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"yuanxiaoleiji3\",\"price\":4000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":39,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200055,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"长生诀(金)\",\"dsc\":\"江湖失传已久的神功，因久未使用，如今存放于该宝箱中，打开即可获得对应武功残篇。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746328,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"chunjieleiji2\",\"price\":4000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":41,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200056,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"太玄经\",\"dsc\":\"这是江湖先贤从西汉扬雄所著的《太玄经》中悟出的部分武学，玄妙无比，非常人所能修炼。可与梦天掌互备。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746330,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"caiweijianfabox1\",\"price\":5000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":46,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200058,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"采薇剑法\",\"dsc\":\"相传，孤竹国国君的二位皇子为反对周王的主张，不食周粟。兄弟二人隐居首阳山采薇而食，创下这门名留青史的采薇剑法。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746331,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"tiancantuifa\",\"price\":4000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":48,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200059,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"天残腿法\",\"dsc\":\"天残腿法相传乃是数百年前的天残老人所创，其招式灵动飘逸，劲力极大，是一门极为高深的武学。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746332,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"yuenvjianfabox1\",\"price\":5000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":49,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200060,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"越女剑法\",\"dsc\":\"相传，越国有位姑娘从白猿身上领悟了一套剑法，女子来到军中，将剑法传于士兵，却不肯留下姓名。后来，人们便将这套剑法称为越女剑法。\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746333,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"bdjhmiji\",\"price\":1000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":54,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200061,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"拔刀居合秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是一本一刀流的秘籍，内有一刀流的绝学招式——拔刀斩、居合斩的秘籍残页各十张。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746334,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"bawangmiji\",\"price\":1000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":55,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200062,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"霸王秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是一本霸王枪法的秘籍，内有霸王枪法的绝学招式——力拔山兮的秘籍残页十张。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746335,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"niekongbumiji\",\"price\":1000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":56,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200063,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"蹑空步秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是一本蹑空步的秘籍，内有虚空踏步绝学招式——蹑空步的秘籍残页十张。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746336,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"caiweimiji\",\"price\":1000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":57,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200064,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"采薇秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是一本采薇剑法的秘籍，内有采薇剑法的绝学招式——孤竹傲、首阳归的秘籍残页各十张。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746337,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"jiulongshitianmiji\",\"price\":800,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":2,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":58,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200065,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"九龙噬天秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是九龙鞭法的秘籍，内有九龙鞭法的绝学招式——九龙噬天的秘籍残页十张。\",\"times\":2},{\"id\":746338,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"tiancanmiji\",\"price\":800,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":59,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200066,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"天残秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是一本天残秘籍，内有天残腿法的绝学招式——天残地缺的秘籍残页十张。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746339,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"jiayimiji\",\"price\":800,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":60,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200067,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"破立秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是一本焕衣神功的秘籍，内有焕衣神功的绝学招式——破而后立的秘籍残页十张。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746340,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"taixuangongmiji\",\"price\":1000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":61,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200068,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"太玄经秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是一本太玄经的秘籍，内有太玄经的绝学招式——深藏身与名、千里不留行的秘籍残页十张。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746341,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"yuenvjianfamiji\",\"price\":1000,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":62,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":200069,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"越女秘籍\",\"dsc\":\"这是一本越女剑法的秘籍，内有越女剑法的绝学招式——竹影剑气、疾刃突进的秘籍残页各十张。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746342,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"jiu106\",\"price\":160,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":10,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":6,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":300003,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"醉梦生\",\"dsc\":\"这是一坛醉梦生，相传此酒可以让人忘却烦恼，醉生梦死。\",\"times\":10},{\"id\":746345,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"fuelbox1\",\"price\":200,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":5,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":13,\"type\":[\"T\",\"H\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":300035,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"燧人氏煤炭箱\",\"dsc\":\"这是一个燧人氏煤炭箱，精装着无烟煤和融铁煤各15个。\",\"times\":5},{\"id\":746346,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"putizi1\",\"price\":75,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":30,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":94,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:34\",\"gid\":300037,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"菩提子\",\"dsc\":\"菩提子使用可提升快速提升内力值。\",\"times\":30},{\"id\":746365,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"baixuehuicuibox01\",\"price\":500,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":10,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":12,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":300244,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"百学荟萃箱\",\"dsc\":\"少侠可开出相马术、炼丹术、占星术、追踪术、鲁班术、相面术、仵作术、岐黄之术、墨家机关术、庙算之术、武穆遗书秘籍中的一种。\",\"times\":10},{\"id\":746371,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"zhounianqidaoju1\",\"price\":250,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":30,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":23,\"type\":[\"T\",\"S\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":300250,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"潜能丹(5颗)\",\"dsc\":\"内藏五颗潜能丹,潜能丹使用后会提升大量人物潜能。\",\"times\":30},{\"id\":746372,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"zhounianqidaoju3\",\"price\":350,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":20,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":24,\"type\":[\"T\",\"S\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":300251,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"静心丸(10瓶)\",\"dsc\":\"内藏十瓶静心丸，静心丸使用后可以提升闭关修炼成功率，并且不会走火入魔。\",\"times\":20},{\"id\":746376,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"dingzhiwan\",\"price\":60,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":5,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":28,\"type\":[\"T\",\"S\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":300255,\"itype\":2,\"name\":\"定志丸\",\"dsc\":\"只有服药者体内存在来自他人的内力时，才能抵御此药引起的真气紊乱，否则内力尽失；经脉培元时使用、提高获得特殊经脉天赋的几率，需要至少传承一次。\",\"times\":5},{\"id\":746377,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"szjdj2\",\"price\":6800,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":1,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":38,\"type\":[\"T\",\"W\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":300256,\"itype\":2,\"name\":\"信笺\",\"dsc\":\"凌小姐的信笺，上面用簪花小楷写着几行字，笺底绘有独特的菊花暗纹，难以仿制。（这是一份来自恋人间的信任，可让你获取天下武学至宝灵照经）\",\"times\":1},{\"id\":746379,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"newfudai238\",\"price\":10,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":40,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":1,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":301313,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"江湖桂月福袋\",\"dsc\":\"凭运气能开出戏曲面具(孔明)，玉露项链、流云甘露、行功散、静心丸、碎银、黄金、潜能丹、遁地符中的一种。\",\"times\":40},{\"id\":746380,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"newfudai239\",\"price\":60,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":30,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":2,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":301314,\"itype\":1,\"name\":\"江湖仲秋福袋\",\"dsc\":\"凭运气能开出戏曲面具(山鬼)、天马、虎蛟、行功散、门派顶级残页、干草人偶、静心丸、潜能丹、黄金中的一种。\",\"times\":30},{\"id\":746381,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"ningshendan\",\"price\":5,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":300,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":95,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400002,\"itype\":10,\"name\":\"凝神丹\",\"dsc\":\"一颗褐色浑圆的丹药，散发出淡淡的药味，服用后静心凝神，练功事半功倍。\",\"times\":300},{\"id\":746382,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"accpoint\",\"price\":5,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":600,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":93,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400003,\"itype\":6,\"name\":\"固身元气\",\"dsc\":\"养气固身，神采焕发，做什么都必然倍道而进。\",\"times\":600},{\"id\":746383,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"minditem4\",\"price\":1880,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":92,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400004,\"itype\":6,\"name\":\"聚心丹\",\"dsc\":\"一个精致的紫金葫芦中装着的丹药，取之伴有阵阵奇特香气，相传服用此丹可使人神清气爽心旷神怡。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746384,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"minditem2\",\"price\":380,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":90,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400006,\"itype\":6,\"name\":\"谧心丸\",\"dsc\":\"通体青色的药丸，闻之似有淡淡幽香，服用后可使人心神安定。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746385,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"minditem1\",\"price\":190,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":89,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400009,\"itype\":6,\"name\":\"清心散\",\"dsc\":\"一包用白色油纸包裹的朱色粉末，据说出自名声显赫的医药世家，服用可令人舒心安神。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746386,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"minditem3\",\"price\":750,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":3,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":91,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400010,\"itype\":6,\"name\":\"凝心露\",\"dsc\":\"翠绿透彻的玉瓶中装着的半透明药液，闻之清香阵阵，凝心露功效颇为奇特，服用令可人心神饱满全身清爽。\",\"times\":3},{\"id\":746387,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"glczwanquanchongzhi001\",\"price\":150,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":10,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":84,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400011,\"itype\":5,\"name\":\"复思之书\",\"dsc\":\"此乃复思之书，使用该书卷可以将任何招式完全重置。但招式品质不会发生变化。\",\"times\":10},{\"id\":746388,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"glczwanquanchongzhi002\",\"price\":50,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":10,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":85,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400012,\"itype\":5,\"name\":\"弃定之书\",\"dsc\":\"此乃弃定之书，使用该书卷可以将精妙招式完全重置，但招式品质不会发生变化。\",\"times\":10},{\"id\":746389,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"glczwanquanchongzhi003\",\"price\":75,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":10,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":86,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400013,\"itype\":5,\"name\":\"重思之书\",\"dsc\":\"此乃重思之书，使用该书卷可以将超凡招式完全重置，但招式品质不会发生变化。\",\"times\":10},{\"id\":746390,\"sid\":12399,\"itemId\":\"gailiangshengpin002\",\"price\":125,\"number\":1,\"is_again\":\"N\",\"extra\":{\"limit\":2,\"start\":\"2021-01-01 00:00:00\",\"end\":\"2026-09-30 23:59:59\"},\"is_inherit\":\"Y\",\"inde\":88,\"type\":[\"T\",\"D\"],\"update_time\":\"2026-08-26 17:12:35\",\"gid\":400015,\"itype\":5,\"name\":\"超群之书\",\"dsc\":\"此乃超群之书，使用该书卷可以将普通招式提升至超凡招式。\",\"times\"